```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[用户请求] --> B{调用LLM分析}
    B --> C[解析LLM响应]
    C --> D{是否完成?}
    D -->|是| E[输出最终回答]
    D -->|否| F[执行工具调用]
    F --> G[获取工具执行结果]
    G --> H{记录到上下文}
    H --> I{检查迭代次数}
    I -->|未达上限| B
    I -->|已达上限| J[输出警告信息]
    
    subgraph 工具列表
        F --> F1[list_files - 列出文件]
        F --> F2[read_file - 读取文件]
        F --> F3[create_file - 创建文件]
        F --> F4[delete_file - 删除文件]
        F --> F5[rename_file - 重命名]
        F --> F6[fetch_web_content - 获取网页]
        F --> F7[search_files_content - 搜索内容]
    end
    
    subgraph 上下文管理
        H --> H1[调用历史记录]
        H --> H2[中间变量存储]
        H --> H3[迭代计数]
    end
    
    subgraph 测试场景
        S1[文件搜索链式调用] --> S1a[list_files]
        S1a --> S1b[search_files_content]
        S1b --> S1c[总结结果]
        
        S2[多文件操作] --> S2a[read_file 1.txt]
        S2a --> S2b[read_file 2.txt]
        S2b --> S2c[create_file result.txt]
        
        S3[网页处理链式调用] --> S3a[fetch_web_content]
        S3a --> S3b[create_file summary.txt]
    end
    
    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style E fill:#9f9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style J fill:#f99,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
```